{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42612","headline":"宁州道中 · 杨夔","name":"宁州道中","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"城枕萧关路，胡兵日夕临。\n唯凭一炬火，以慰万人心。\n春老雪犹重，沙寒草不深。\n如何驱匹马，向此独闲吟。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杨夔","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42612.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42612","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}